[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Italian Game"]
[Variation "Legal Mate"]
[ECO "C50"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "white"]
[Tricks "trap,pin,mate-threat"]
[Themes "queen-sacrifice,minor-piece-mate"]
[Kind "for-us"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 d6 4. Nc3 Bg4 5. h3 Bh5"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 d6 4. Nc3 Bg4 5. h3 Bh5? { Keeps the pin on the knight at f3. It looks natural, but it leaves the e5 pawn defended only by a pawn that cannot move away. }
6. Nxe5! { Offers the queen. If Black takes it, White has a forced mate. } 6... Bxd1? 7. Bxf7+ Ke7 8. Nd5# *
